and because of the study,
so that's ridiculous.

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:54.130
No, what I was describing
is China because of its

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:56.810
totalitarian or authoritarian,
rather, government

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:59.000
and its collectivist culture

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:04.000
was able to put 930 million
people under a kind of

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:08.910
home-based quarantine
beginning January the 25th

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:09.745
for like eight weeks.

00:23:09.745 --> 00:23:12.270
It never in the history of public health,

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:14.350
has so many people been under

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:17.490
such restriction for so
long to my knowledge.

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:20.270
It's unbelievable what
they were able to do

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:23.110
because of their culture
and their government.

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:25.990
And I call this a social
nuclear weapon because,

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:29.060
it gives you a sense of
what they were fighting,

00:23:29.060 --> 00:23:31.680
the power of this pathogen
that they were confronting

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:32.820
that they resorted to this.

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:36.150
China did not decide to do this for fun.

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:39.040
And when I was trying to
communicate with that thread,

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:40.230
that was now weeks ago,

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:42.350
was to try to get attention
in the United States,

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:45.110
like, look what's happening in China.

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:47.150
This is not gonna just stay there,

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:49.520
this is not like a Chinese problem.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:53.170
They've decided to put a billion
people under home arrest,

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:55.500
for two months for fun.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.750
We need to prepare, we
need to think about this

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:00.010
because, the virus is
gonna reach our shores.

00:24:00.010 --> 00:24:01.390
In fact, already when I was writing that,

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:02.920
it had reached our shores.

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:04.730
This is what happens in pandemics.

00:24:04.730 --> 00:24:06.610
No matter where the disease starts,

00:24:06.610 --> 00:24:08.620
it spreads around the globe,

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:10.490
and by the time you're aware of it,

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:13.330
even if you're aware of it,
30 days after inception,

00:24:13.330 --> 00:24:16.010
it's too late given movements of people.

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:18.020
Even frankly, a hundred years ago,

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:21.020
given movements of people on steamboats,

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:26.020
and on trains and big compact
cities, the virus spreads.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:32.150
So, anyway, I was trying to
describe what the Chinese

00:24:33.080 --> 00:24:36.340
had done and it is
astonishing what they did.

00:24:36.340 --> 00:24:39.870
And they have brought down
their cases in a country of 1.4

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:43.470
billion people to under...

00:24:43.470 --> 00:24:44.710
Now, it's like, I don't even know,

00:24:44.710 --> 00:24:46.600
it's like 10 cases a day or something

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:48.040
in the whole nation.

00:24:48.040 --> 00:24:51.890
So this is, unfortunately what
we are facing in our country.

00:24:51.890 --> 00:24:54.290
And we have different strengths
and different weaknesses

00:24:54.290 --> 00:24:55.150
compared to China.

00:24:55.150 --> 00:24:58.100
One of their weaknesses,
we have a commitment

00:24:58.100 --> 00:25:01.060
to free and open
expression in our society.

00:25:01.060 --> 00:25:04.110
And in China, unfortunately,
the doctor who first tried

00:25:04.110 --> 00:25:06.713
to sound the alarm, Dr. Wenliang Li,

00:25:07.700 --> 00:25:10.293
he was brought in on
charges of rumor mongering.

00:25:11.210 --> 00:25:14.670
He was basically using the
Facebook equivalent in China,

00:25:14.670 --> 00:25:16.547
and messaging his friends and saying,

00:25:16.547 --> 00:25:18.787
"Oh my God, I'm seeing all
these patients in the hospital

00:25:18.787 --> 00:25:20.517
"with this particular kind of pneumonia,

00:25:20.517 --> 00:25:22.520
"I'm worried we have a new pathogen."

00:25:22.520 --> 00:25:24.080
And the local authorities called him in

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:26.100
and accused him of rumor mongering,

00:25:26.100 --> 00:25:28.680
which is not a crime in our society.

00:25:29.551 --> 00:25:31.810
- Not yet.
- No

00:25:31.810 --> 00:25:35.430
So, I mean our strengths in
our society include our wealth,

00:25:35.430 --> 00:25:39.140
our openness, our tremendous scientists.

00:25:39.140 --> 00:25:40.760
But we haven't been
playing to those strengths,

00:25:40.760 --> 00:25:43.410
we've not been listening
to our scientists,

00:25:43.410 --> 00:25:45.490
we've not been deploying our wealth,

00:25:45.490 --> 00:25:49.060
we haven't been acting the
way we should be acting,

00:25:49.060 --> 00:25:51.710
and taking our strengths
to cope with this.

00:25:51.710 --> 00:25:54.546
And the Chinese use
different strengths and they

00:25:54.546 --> 00:25:57.030
frankly, coped very effectively with this.

00:25:57.030 --> 00:25:59.160
I should say, just to be clear,

00:25:59.160 --> 00:26:02.640
what the Chinese
accomplished was they stopped

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:06.720
the spread of the pathogen,
but they did not eradicate it.

00:26:06.720 --> 00:26:09.890
So the pathogen is still there,
and it will come back even

00:26:09.890 --> 00:26:12.620
to China, as it will come back to us.

00:26:12.620 --> 00:26:15.600
But they have bought themselves
a huge amount of time

00:26:15.600 --> 00:26:17.260
to organize their response now,

00:26:17.260 --> 00:26:21.050
so they don't lose countless lives.

00:26:21.050 --> 00:26:23.100
- Okay, so actually, I think
most of the other things in

00:26:23.100 --> 00:26:24.320
the thread you've already hit,

00:26:24.320 --> 00:26:26.160
so I'll only ask you one more
