00:33:18.330 --> 00:33:19.410
But I would suggest to you

00:33:19.410 --> 00:33:22.210
that we would likely
have faced that anyway,

00:33:22.210 --> 00:33:23.740
if we had done nothing,

00:33:23.740 --> 00:33:26.340
but then we also would have
had all of these deaths,

00:33:27.430 --> 00:33:29.430
so I think it's necessary.

00:33:29.430 --> 00:33:30.263
- Yeah, all right.

